   "headline": "Seoul stocks drop more than 5% as chipmakers lead the slide",
   "when": "Fri 20 Nov · Seoul close",
   "what": "The KOSPI fell 267.93 points, or 5.21%, to 4,869.96. Samsung Electronics lost 7.01% to 183,100 won and SK hynix lost 5.92% to 1,113,000 won. Foreign investors were net sellers of 1.13 trillion won, while individuals bought a net 1.59 trillion won. Program trading was paused for five minutes around noon. The won traded near 1,336 per dollar. Japan's benchmark also fell more than 5%.",
